# Pristine lesson files are the reset point a Solution is copied from — they are
# never edited, so Prettier must never rewrite them either. A format-on-save in
# an open exercise.test.js once produced a 200-line whitespace-only diff.
#
# NOTE: Prettier reads .prettierignore only from the directory it is RUN from —
# it does not walk up from each file the way .prettierrc does. So this file
# applies when Prettier runs with mastering-javascript/ as its working directory,
# which includes opening this folder as the editor's workspace root. Running it
# from the repo root will NOT see this file.
**/exercise.js
**/exercise.test.js
**/fixtures/**

node_modules/
